PC PC_CM_OkBalanceForget {} @ CMOkBalanceForget
process CMOkBalanceForget@cardIn
atom :'cardIn'
atom :'grant'
atom :'showBalance'
atom :'cancel'
atom :'cardEject'
atom :'cardSwallow'
atom :'tock'
atom tock2:'tock'
atom tock3:'tock'
after cardIn->grant
after grant->showBalance
after showBalance->cancel
after cancel->cardEject
after cardEject->tock
after tock->tock2
after tock2->tock3
after tock3->cardSwallow
reference RefCashMachine:CashMachine
import CashMachine as CMI for PC_CashMachine
ref_connector RefCashMachine->CMI
after cardSwallow->RefCashMachine
